{"id":"en_dubbed-the-substitute-heart","title":"[Dubbed]The Substitute Heart","titleEn":"[Dubbed]The Substitute Heart","description":"Following the end of a past relationship, Sienna turns to Adam—a man who closely resembles her former partner—and marries him largely as a way to cope emotionally. Three years into the arrangement, she decides to walk away, determined to rebuild her own identity and professional path. It is only after she is gone that Adam, a detached and strategic CEO, comes to understand that his feelings for her had deepened into love well before she left.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbedthe-substitute-heart/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbedthe-substitute-heart/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Modern","Youth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh68y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_dubbed-the-substitute-heart_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh68y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-the-substitute-heart_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh68y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-the-substitute-heart_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh68y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-the-substitute-heart_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh68y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-the-substitute-he